<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tarifario Sponsors - Mundial 2026</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
        .gold-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b49248 0%, #e5c06d 50%, #b49248 100%); }
        .silver-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #71717a 0%, #a1a1aa 50%, #71717a 100%); }
        .bronze-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c2d12 0%, #c2410c 50%, #7c2d12 100%); }
        .dark-card { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
        .glass-table { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-200">

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="relative py-20 px-6 text-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/carbon-fibre.png')]"></div>
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/ios-filled/100/ffffff/trophy.png" alt="Cup" class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-6 opacity-80">
            <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-500 font-bold mb-3 text-sm">Oportunidad Comercial Exclusiva</p>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-4 text-white tracking-tight">TARIFARIO OFICIAL <span class="text-amber-500">SPONSORS</span></h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 font-light">Cobertura Especial Copa Mundial de la FIFA 2026 | Argentina & Paraguay</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
        
        <!-- Pricing Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-24">
            
            <!-- Tier 1: Full Sponsor -->
            <div class="dark-card rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300 ring-2 ring-amber-500/50">
                <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 gold-gradient text-black px-6 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest">
                    Exclusividad Total
                </div>
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">🥇 1. FULL SPONSOR</h3>
                    <p class="text-amber-500 font-medium">Máxima exposición y jerarquía</p>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10 flex-grow text-slate-300 text-sm">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
                        <strong>Exclusividad absoluta por rubro.</strong>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
                        Menciones en TV, Radio, Digital y Magazines.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
                        Prioridad en entrevistas y segmentos exclusivos.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
                        Presencia destacada en toda la cobertura oficial.
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center">
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase">Por partido</span>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">USD 2.000</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-amber-500 text-xs uppercase font-bold">Pack 4 Partidos</span>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">USD 5.000</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 2: Sponsor Secciones -->
            <div class="dark-card rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col transform hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">🥈 2. SECCIONES</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 font-medium">Integración estratégica</p>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10 flex-grow text-slate-300 text-sm">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-500"></span>
                        Marca integrada en segmentos específicos.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-500"></span>
                        Presencia activa en TV, Radio y Digital.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-500"></span>
                        Asociación directa a contenidos de valor.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3 italic text-slate-500">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-700"></span>
                        Hasta 4 marcas por categoría.
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center">
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase">Por partido</span>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">USD 1.000</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase font-bold">Pack 4 Partidos</span>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">USD 2.500</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tier 3: Menciones + Logo -->
            <div class="dark-card rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col transform hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">🥉 3. MENCIONES</h3>
                    <p class="text-orange-600 font-medium">Presencia y alcance</p>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10 flex-grow text-slate-300 text-sm">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-700"></span>
                        Mención de marca en entrevistas.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-700"></span>
                        Colaboraciones en Redes Sociales.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-700"></span>
                        Posteos con logo y contenido digital.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-700"></span>
                        Ideal para Pymes y Emprendimientos.
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center">
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase">Por partido</span>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">USD 500</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase font-bold">Pack 4 Partidos</span>
                        <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">USD 1.200</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Investment Summary Table -->
        <section class="mb-24">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">📊 Resumen de Inversión</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Planes diseñados para cada nivel de marca</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden">
                <table class="w-full text-left">
                    <thead class="bg-white/5">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase text-xs tracking-wider">Categoría</th>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase text-xs tracking-wider">Inversión 1 Partido</th>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase text-xs tracking-wider">Inversión 4 Partidos</th>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase text-xs tracking-wider text-right">Beneficio Pack</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold text-amber-500">Full Sponsor (Oro)</td>
                            <td class="p-6">USD 2.000</td>
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold text-white">USD 5.000</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right text-green-500 font-bold">Ahorro USD 3.000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-300">Sponsor Secciones (Plata)</td>
                            <td class="p-6">USD 1.000</td>
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold text-white">USD 2.500</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right text-green-500 font-bold">Ahorro USD 1.500</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold text-orange-600">Menciones + Logo (Bronce)</td>
                            <td class="p-6">USD 500</td>
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold text-white">USD 1.200</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right text-green-500 font-bold">Ahorro USD 800</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Match Schedule Section -->
        <section class="mb-24">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">🗓️ Calendario de Exposición</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Fechas de máxima visibilidad para su marca</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glass-table rounded-3xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                <table class="w-full text-left">
                    <thead class="bg-white/10">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Fecha</th>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Encuentro</th>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Estadio / Ciudad</th>
                            <th class="p-6 font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest text-right">Hora (ET)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/10">
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors border-l-4 border-amber-500">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">10 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white"><span class="text-amber-500 font-extrabold uppercase text-xs block">Evento Global</span> México vs Invitado</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">Estadio Azteca, CDMX</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">19:00</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">12 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white font-semibold">Paraguay vs Estados Unidos</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">SoFi Stadium, Inglewood, CA</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">21:00</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors border-l-4 border-blue-500">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">16 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white font-semibold">Argentina vs Argelia</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">Arrowhead Stadium, Kansas City, MO</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">21:00</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">20 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white font-semibold">Paraguay vs Ganador Playoff C</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">Levi’s Stadium, Santa Clara, CA</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">00:00</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors border-l-4 border-blue-500">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">22 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white font-semibold">Argentina vs Austria</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">AT&T Stadium, Arlington, TX</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">13:00</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">25 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white font-semibold">Paraguay vs Australia</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">Levi’s Stadium, Santa Clara, CA</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">22:00</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors border-l-4 border-blue-500">
                            <td class="p-6 font-bold">27 Jun</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-white font-semibold">Jordania vs Argentina</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-slate-400">AT&T Stadium, Arlington, TX</td>
                            <td class="p-6 text-right font-mono font-bold">22:00</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 text-center">
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs italic">* Los horarios y sedes están sujetos a cambios oficiales de la FIFA.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Section -->
        <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 to-indigo-900 rounded-[3rem] p-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
            <div class="relative z-10">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Asocie su marca al evento más grande del mundo</h2>
                <p class="text-blue-200 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
                    Asegure su lugar en la cobertura más esperada del año. Cupos de exclusividad limitados por rubro comercial.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-6">
                    <a href="mailto:info@globalmix.online" class="bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-black px-12 py-4 rounded-full font-extrabold text-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-xl">
                        SOLICITAR PATROCINIO
                    </a>
                    <div class="text-left">
                        <p class="text-blue-300 text-sm uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Contacto Directo</p>
                        <p class="text-white text-xl font-bold">info@globalmix.online</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Decorative light -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-500 rounded-full blur-[120px] opacity-20"></div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="py-12 border-t border-white/5 text-center text-slate-500 text-sm">
        <p class="mb-2">© 2026 GLOBAL MIX | Producción Audiovisual & Prensa</p>
        <p class="font-light italic">Propuesta de Patrocinio - FIFA World Cup 2026</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

